Comment: 0,0:00:00.95,0:01:01.03,OP,,0,0,0,,Abertura
Comment: 0,0:01:01.03,0:03:52.03,OP,,0,0,0,,Deixe Meu Corpo para Trás
Comment: 0,0:04:01.21,0:06:31.98,OP,,0,0,0,,Ciúmes
Comment: 0,0:06:31.98,0:09:20.28,OP,,0,0,0,,Namorados
Comment: 0,0:09:20.28,0:12:25.96,OP,,0,0,0,,Bolhas
Comment: 0,0:12:25.96,0:12:30.97,OP,,0,0,0,,Prévia
Dialogue: 20,0:01:01.03,0:01:03.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eu me chamo Motoyama Tomomichi.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:03.48,0:01:04.80,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sou feio.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meu amigo quer se encontrar\N comigo atrás da escola.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:07.00,0:01:09.60,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O que será que ele quer?
Dialogue: 20,0:01:09.60,0:01:10.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Yamane-dono!
Dialogue: 20,0:01:12.01,0:01:13.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Motoyama-kun.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:18.50,0:01:20.77,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Essa deve ser a Kurihara-dono.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:20.77,0:01:24.17,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}O tipo de moça que demonstrou afeição\N para um homem asqueroso como o Yamane.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:24.62,0:01:28.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Por que você me chamou aqui\N quando vocês estavam sozinhos?
Dialogue: 20,0:01:28.63,0:01:31.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Bom, a Kurihara-san me chamou aqui.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:31.03,0:01:33.59,Main,,0,0,0,,É a primeira vez que uma garota me chama\N para nos encontrarmos atrás da escola.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:33.59,0:01:36.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Fiquei com medo de vir sozinho,\N então queria que você viesse junto.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:38.40,0:01:41.90,Main,,0,0,0,,E-Então, o que você quer, Kurihara-san?
Dialogue: 20,0:01:43.78,0:01:46.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Fiz muito pudim, então pensei em dividir um pouco.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:46.76,0:01:49.16,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Que desculpa mais boba.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:49.16,0:01:52.66,Main,,0,0,0,,E-Eu não mereço.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:55.22,0:01:57.73,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yamane-dono parece estar\N tão fixado em sua feiura,
Dialogue: 20,0:01:57.73,0:02:00.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}que não entende o que a\N moça está tentando fazer.
Dialogue: 20,0:02:00.19,0:02:03.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Agradeça da melhor forma que puder.\N Ela fez o pudim pensando em você.
Dialogue: 20,0:02:03.92,0:02:05.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Nem pensar, nem pensar! De jeito nenhum!
Dialogue: 20,0:02:05.82,0:02:07.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Você está insultando ela!
Dialogue: 20,0:02:07.84,0:02:11.01,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se o Yamane-dono não quer se mexer...
Dialogue: 20,0:02:11.54,0:02:13.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Kurihara-dono, né?
Dialogue: 20,0:02:13.94,0:02:17.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Peço desculpas por interromper,\N então vou deixar vocês dois a sós—
Dialogue: 20,0:02:17.63,0:02:19.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, por favor, fique.
Dialogue: 20,0:02:19.35,0:02:20.22,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Até você?
Dialogue: 20,0:02:20.22,0:02:21.36,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Até você é lerda?
Dialogue: 20,0:02:21.86,0:02:24.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Você está ganhando pudim, Yamane-dono!
Dialogue: 20,0:02:25.52,0:02:27.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Acho que eu não deveria ser o único, mas...
Dialogue: 20,0:02:28.69,0:02:30.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Na verdade, eu trouxe dois.
Dialogue: 20,0:02:30.57,0:02:31.94,Main,,0,0,0,,É mesmo?
Dialogue: 20,0:02:31.94,0:02:33.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso é ótimo, não é, Motoyama-kun?
Dialogue: 20,0:02:33.54,0:02:37.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Ela fez esse pudim para você, Yamane-dono!
Dialogue: 20,0:02:38.54,0:02:40.21,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Do que você está falando?
Dialogue: 20,0:02:40.21,0:02:42.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Kurihara-san está dividindo por cortesia!
Dialogue: 20,0:02:42.71,0:02:43.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 20,0:02:43.79,0:02:46.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Ela chamou você para vir atrás\N da escola. Isso não é só cortesia!
Dialogue: 20,0:02:47.09,0:02:49.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Você percebeu, né?
Dialogue: 20,0:02:49.51,0:02:51.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Como a Kurihara-dono se sente sobre você?
Dialogue: 20,0:02:51.01,0:02:52.80,Main,,0,0,0,,P-Pare!
Dialogue: 20,0:02:52.80,0:02:56.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Boatos poderiam surgir se ela\N me desse esse pudim em público!
Dialogue: 20,0:02:56.61,0:02:57.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Se for possível...
Dialogue: 20,0:02:58.16,0:03:00.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Você está se depreciando demais, Yamane-dono.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:00.47,0:03:02.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Apenas aceite o gesto.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:02.77,0:03:05.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Como pode ser tão cruel, Motoyama-kun?
Dialogue: 20,0:03:08.47,0:03:10.61,Main,,0,0,0,,M-Me pegou.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:11.00,0:03:14.12,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hã? Mas nem toquei tão forte.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:14.75,0:03:17.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Parece que a Kurihara-dono é\N mais importante para você
Dialogue: 20,0:03:17.61,0:03:20.41,Main,,0,0,0,,do que eu, seu melhor amigo.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:21.69,0:03:24.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Então, vou indo.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:24.39,0:03:26.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Aproveitem o pudim.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:27.74,0:03:28.88,Main,,0,0,0,,M-Motoyama-kun!
Dialogue: 20,0:03:30.34,0:03:31.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Hum...
Dialogue: 20,0:03:32.69,0:03:35.06,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Peço que entendam a situação...
Dialogue: 20,0:03:35.06,0:03:36.98,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Estou com vergonha da minha péssima atuação.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:36.98,0:03:38.10,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Quero sair daqui!
Dialogue: 20,0:03:38.65,0:03:41.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Da próxima vez, farei um para você também, tá?
Dialogue: 20,0:03:43.67,0:03:46.96,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ela é uma mulher melhor do que imaginei.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:46.96,0:03:49.11,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Desejo o melhor a vocês.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:54.74,0:03:56.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Certo, já vou indo.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:56.92,0:03:58.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, certo.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:58.25,0:03:59.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Obrigado.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:02.82,0:04:05.96,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ultimamente, tenho a impressão de que\N minha namorada está incomodada com algo.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:06.55,0:04:08.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Gouda-kun, pode abrir para mim?
Dialogue: 20,0:04:10.09,0:04:10.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Toma.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:11.11,0:04:13.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, obrigada!
Dialogue: 20,0:04:15.93,0:04:16.82,Main,,0,0,0,,O que foi?
Dialogue: 20,0:04:20.14,0:04:23.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Kamine, fiz alguma coisa\N errada nesses últimos dias?
Dialogue: 20,0:04:23.07,0:04:24.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã? P-Por quê?
Dialogue: 20,0:04:24.54,0:04:26.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Tenho a sensação de que você está brava comigo.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:26.74,0:04:28.51,Main,,0,0,0,,N-Na verdade não.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:28.51,0:04:30.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Você não fez nada.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:30.61,0:04:31.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Entendo.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:31.30,0:04:34.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Takeru, vamos fazer uma queda de braço.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:34.24,0:04:35.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Preparar, e...
Dialogue: 20,0:04:37.25,0:04:39.88,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tenho quase certeza de que a\N Kamine está brava com alguma coisa.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:39.88,0:04:40.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Gouda!
Dialogue: 20,0:04:41.22,0:04:43.24,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Preciso pedir desculpa pra Kamine.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:43.24,0:04:45.17,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tenho que ir logo ao nosso local de encontro.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:45.56,0:04:46.63,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ela não está aqui.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:46.63,0:04:48.11,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ela não chegou ainda?
Dialogue: 20,0:04:50.41,0:04:52.79,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}E-Ela está me bloqueando?
Dialogue: 20,0:04:52.79,0:04:54.14,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ela ficou tão brava assim?
Dialogue: 20,0:04:54.14,0:04:55.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Adivinha quem é.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:56.15,0:04:57.25,Main,,0,0,0,,K-Kamine.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:57.25,0:04:57.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Você chegou.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:57.98,0:04:58.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:58.78,0:05:00.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Achou que eu tinha ido embora?
Dialogue: 20,0:05:00.16,0:05:01.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Ido embora?
Dialogue: 20,0:05:01.51,0:05:03.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Achei que você me odiasse.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:03.30,0:05:04.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, não.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:04.45,0:05:05.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:05.89,0:05:09.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Queria que você se preocupasse\N comigo, então fui um pouco malvada.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:09.77,0:05:12.40,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Você estava tão brava comigo\N que teve que ser maldosa?
Dialogue: 20,0:05:12.40,0:05:14.24,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Desculpe.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:14.24,0:05:15.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos embora.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:15.73,0:05:17.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Não vai me dar a mão?
Dialogue: 20,0:05:17.90,0:05:19.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Quero dizer, você pegou na mão da Patricia-chan.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:20.87,0:05:24.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Está zangada porque fiz uma\N queda de braço com a Patricia?
Dialogue: 20,0:05:25.64,0:05:26.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Era isso.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:26.62,0:05:27.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Você poderia ter me dito.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:27.54,0:05:29.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu teria feito uma queda de braço com você.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:29.20,0:05:30.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Não!
Dialogue: 20,0:05:30.25,0:05:32.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Não quero fazer uma queda de braço com você.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:32.05,0:05:33.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Na verdade, não quero que você faça também.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:33.74,0:05:34.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Como assim?
Dialogue: 20,0:05:34.93,0:05:38.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Nada, você vai me odiar se eu falar.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:38.29,0:05:40.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe por incomodar você.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:41.24,0:05:44.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Por que eu te odiaria, Kamine?
Dialogue: 20,0:05:44.70,0:05:46.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Sou o seu namorado, né?
Dialogue: 20,0:05:46.59,0:05:48.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouvirei tudo o que quiser me dizer.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:48.48,0:05:49.94,Main,,0,0,0,,É-É mesmo?
Dialogue: 20,0:05:49.94,0:05:51.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Não vai me odiar?
Dialogue: 20,0:05:51.19,0:05:51.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:52.48,0:05:53.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Então...
Dialogue: 20,0:05:54.17,0:05:56.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Não fique muito próximo de outras garotas.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:56.15,0:05:58.28,Main,,0,0,0,,E comece a me chamar pelo meu primeiro nome.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:58.28,0:06:02.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Com a Patricia-chan é inevitável, mas sou\N a única que pode te chamar de Takeru.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:02.12,0:06:03.93,Main,,0,0,0,,E não dê a mão para outras garotas,
Dialogue: 20,0:06:03.93,0:06:04.79,Main,,0,0,0,,nem numa queda de braço.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:05.12,0:06:07.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Sou a única que pode segurar suas mãos.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:07.00,0:06:09.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Pode ajudar a abrir garrafas,
Dialogue: 20,0:06:09.30,0:06:12.96,Main,,0,0,0,,mas se for legal com alguém, \Nterá que ser ainda mais legal comigo!
Dialogue: 20,0:06:13.82,0:06:15.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Então é isso.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:15.47,0:06:17.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Deve estar pensando que sou chata, não é?
Dialogue: 20,0:06:17.75,0:06:19.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, mas me surpreendeu.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:19.42,0:06:20.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem,
Dialogue: 20,0:06:20.10,0:06:22.18,Main,,0,0,0,,sei que estou sendo estúpida também!
Dialogue: 20,0:06:22.18,0:06:23.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, não me importo.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:24.52,0:06:26.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Então me chame de Ayaka.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:34.48,0:06:37.57,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Já faz um tempo desde que eu e minha\N namorada começamos o relacionamento.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:37.57,0:06:39.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mas não nos beijamos ainda.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:40.02,0:06:41.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Como eu posso beijá-la?
Dialogue: 20,0:06:43.46,0:06:44.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, Chiaki...
Dialogue: 20,0:06:44.53,0:06:46.03,Main,,0,0,0,,O que foi, Kana?
Dialogue: 20,0:06:46.03,0:06:46.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Precisa cagar?
Dialogue: 20,0:06:46.80,0:06:47.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, idiota!
Dialogue: 20,0:06:47.99,0:06:48.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Veja!
Dialogue: 20,0:06:53.45,0:06:55.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Não é o Gouda e a Kamine-san?
Dialogue: 20,0:06:55.62,0:06:57.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Eles não fazem nada na aula.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:57.32,0:06:58.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas estão namorando aqui.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:59.32,0:07:01.19,Main,,0,0,0,,T-Takeru-kun...
Dialogue: 20,0:07:01.19,0:07:02.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim, Kamine?
Dialogue: 20,0:07:02.60,0:07:05.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Poxa, não vai me chamar pelo meu primeiro nome?
Dialogue: 20,0:07:05.76,0:07:07.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A Kamine-san foi sempre assim?
Dialogue: 20,0:07:07.52,0:07:09.67,Main,,0,0,0,,C-Certo.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:09.67,0:07:11.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Ayaka...-san.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:11.26,0:07:12.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso. Isso.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:12.33,0:07:13.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Que foi?
Dialogue: 20,0:07:13.18,0:07:15.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Nada não.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:15.02,0:07:16.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Só queria que você falasse o meu nome.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:17.57,0:07:21.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Chamarei por seu nome o\N quanto você quiser, Ayaka.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:21.49,0:07:24.71,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O Gouda-san sempre foi tão másculo assim?
Dialogue: 20,0:07:24.71,0:07:27.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Acho que as pessoas realmente \Nmudam quando estão apaixonadas.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:27.35,0:07:29.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Apesar de que nós não mudamos nem um pouco...
Dialogue: 20,0:07:30.12,0:07:34.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Kami— Ayaka, você mudou desde\N que começamos a namorar.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:34.96,0:07:36.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, estou incomodando?
Dialogue: 20,0:07:37.10,0:07:39.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, ficou mais fofa.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:39.01,0:07:41.41,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Você também ficou mais fofa, Kana-san.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:41.41,0:07:42.42,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vou acabar com você.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:43.58,0:07:45.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos embora logo.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:45.01,0:07:46.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Dói ver isso.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:46.85,0:07:48.22,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Sim.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:48.22,0:07:50.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Posso ser mais egoísta, então?
Dialogue: 20,0:07:50.71,0:07:51.52,Main,,0,0,0,,O que foi?
Dialogue: 20,0:07:52.02,0:07:55.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Então... queria um beijo.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:57.31,0:07:58.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Agora?
Dialogue: 20,0:07:59.31,0:08:00.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Não podemos?
Dialogue: 20,0:08:00.45,0:08:01.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Claro que não!
Dialogue: 20,0:08:01.52,0:08:03.01,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vocês estão no meio do dia!
Dialogue: 20,0:08:03.01,0:08:03.77,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não é, Kana-san?
Dialogue: 20,0:08:03.77,0:08:04.87,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Até parece!
Dialogue: 20,0:08:04.87,0:08:06.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Certo.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:08.93,0:08:10.97,Main,,0,0,0,,F-Funciona assim mesmo?
Dialogue: 20,0:08:10.97,0:08:13.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Quantas vezes o Gouda beijou esse tempo todo?
Dialogue: 20,0:08:13.22,0:08:15.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, o Gouda-kun está certo!
Dialogue: 20,0:08:15.32,0:08:17.59,Main,,0,0,0,,É esse tipo de iniciativa que você não tem, Chiaki.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:17.98,0:08:19.59,Main,,0,0,0,,N-Não pode ser!
Dialogue: 20,0:08:19.90,0:08:23.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Espere, Gouda-kun, eu não estava pronta para isso!
Dialogue: 20,0:08:23.32,0:08:24.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Não estava?
Dialogue: 20,0:08:24.06,0:08:27.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Go— Você age sempre de repente, Takeru-kun.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:28.57,0:08:29.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:29.60,0:08:30.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Toma isso.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:31.60,0:08:33.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não pode ser!
Dialogue: 20,0:08:33.83,0:08:34.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Viu isso?
Dialogue: 20,0:08:34.41,0:08:35.63,Main,,0,0,0,,A Kamine-san!
Dialogue: 20,0:08:35.63,0:08:36.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Fez aquilo!
Dialogue: 20,0:08:36.65,0:08:37.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Quê?
Dialogue: 20,0:08:37.16,0:08:38.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Espera que eu faça igual?
Dialogue: 20,0:08:38.62,0:08:41.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Não há nada de errado com a\N garota dar o primeiro passo.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:41.10,0:08:43.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Nossa, e você se chama de homem?
Dialogue: 20,0:08:43.99,0:08:46.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos fazer isso direito da próxima vez.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:46.48,0:08:47.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:48.69,0:08:50.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Discutir não vai levar a nada.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:50.90,0:08:51.98,Main,,0,0,0,,É.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:52.67,0:08:54.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Certo, vou te beijar então.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:54.82,0:08:55.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:55.97,0:08:57.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu começo.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:57.50,0:08:59.77,Main,,0,0,0,,No três, então?
Dialogue: 20,0:08:59.77,0:09:00.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Certo.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:03.46,0:09:05.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, dois, e...
Dialogue: 20,0:09:05.05,0:09:07.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, é o Chiaki-kun e a Kana-san.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:07.89,0:09:09.98,Main,,0,0,0,,O Gouda e a Kamine-san!
Dialogue: 20,0:09:09.98,0:09:11.90,Main,,0,0,0,,O que estão fazendo aqui?
Dialogue: 20,0:09:11.90,0:09:13.45,Main,,0,0,0,,N-Nada demais.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:13.45,0:09:15.40,Main,,0,0,0,,O que vocês estavam fazendo?
Dialogue: 20,0:09:15.40,0:09:16.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã? Hm...
Dialogue: 20,0:09:16.82,0:09:18.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Nada de mais.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:18.39,0:09:20.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Que coincidência!
Dialogue: 20,0:09:21.76,0:09:23.28,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Convidei minha namorada para vir aqui.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:23.63,0:09:25.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Obrigada por me chamar.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:25.11,0:09:27.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Não tem ninguém em casa hoje.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:28.41,0:09:31.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hoje eu vou beijá-la!
Dialogue: 20,0:09:31.00,0:09:33.24,Main,,0,0,0,,T-Todo mundo está de férias.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:33.24,0:09:35.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, que horário você tem que ir embora hoje?
Dialogue: 20,0:09:35.53,0:09:38.13,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não, vou fazer ainda mais.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:39.09,0:09:41.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Lá pelas oito.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:41.20,0:09:42.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, certo.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:43.24,0:09:44.84,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maldito Chiaki.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:44.84,0:09:47.10,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Quero dizer, a gente nem se beijou ainda,
Dialogue: 20,0:09:47.10,0:09:49.76,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}então eu esperava isso, mas...
Dialogue: 20,0:09:51.97,0:09:53.02,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hã?
Dialogue: 20,0:09:53.02,0:09:55.23,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Estou usando uma roupa de baixo boa hoje?
Dialogue: 20,0:09:55.61,0:09:57.82,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tenho até as oito.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:57.82,0:09:59.23,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Certo.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:59.84,0:10:00.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Então...
Dialogue: 20,0:10:00.59,0:10:02.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Por que não estudamos para as provas?
Dialogue: 20,0:10:02.10,0:10:03.23,Main,,0,0,0,,B-Boa ideia.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:06.85,0:10:08.48,Main,,0,0,0,,O ar-condicionado está bom?
Dialogue: 20,0:10:08.48,0:10:10.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Acho que está um pouco quente.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:11.05,0:10:12.81,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Por que estou fugindo?
Dialogue: 20,0:10:12.81,0:10:14.45,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Decidi que eu daria o próximo passo hoje!
Dialogue: 20,0:10:14.45,0:10:15.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Kana!
Dialogue: 20,0:10:15.17,0:10:16.26,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Sim?
Dialogue: 20,0:10:16.26,0:10:17.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Qu... bei...
Dialogue: 20,0:10:18.49,0:10:20.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Vai cair química orgânica na prova?
Dialogue: 20,0:10:20.47,0:10:22.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:22.06,0:10:24.43,Main,,0,0,0,,E quimiossíntese?
Dialogue: 20,0:10:24.43,0:10:26.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso também.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:27.20,0:10:28.13,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Droga.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:28.13,0:10:30.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Quer fazer uma pausa?
Dialogue: 20,0:10:30.67,0:10:32.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Vou pegar algo para bebermos.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:32.46,0:10:33.64,Main,,0,0,0,,C-Certo.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:35.03,0:10:38.30,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se continuar assim, não vai dar em nada, novamente.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:38.30,0:10:40.55,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Por que não consigo ser direto?
Dialogue: 20,0:10:42.71,0:10:45.08,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Estamos ficando sem tempo.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:45.08,0:10:47.36,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Preciso sair antes das sete.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:47.36,0:10:50.54,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mas quero que o clima esteja\N bom para o nosso primeiro beijo.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:50.54,0:10:52.66,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não tem motivo para me apressar.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:56.88,0:10:58.26,Main,,0,0,0,,O que foi, Chiaki?
Dialogue: 20,0:10:58.26,0:10:59.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Nada.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:59.27,0:11:00.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Cadê a bebida?
Dialogue: 20,0:11:00.47,0:11:02.17,Main,,0,0,0,,E por que está tão vermelho?
Dialogue: 20,0:11:02.17,0:11:04.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Kana, quer me beijar?
Dialogue: 20,0:11:04.67,0:11:06.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Esse garoto...
Dialogue: 20,0:11:05.74,0:11:06.97,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Lá vamos nós.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:06.97,0:11:08.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Kana...
Dialogue: 20,0:11:08.41,0:11:09.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Espere um pouco!
Dialogue: 20,0:11:09.45,0:11:11.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Você bebeu algo estranho?
Dialogue: 20,0:11:11.04,0:11:13.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Não quero fazer isso assim!
Dialogue: 20,0:11:13.05,0:11:15.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Você ficou falando para eu tomar a iniciativa!
Dialogue: 20,0:11:15.39,0:11:18.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso não quer dizer que é só vir e beijar!
Dialogue: 20,0:11:18.31,0:11:22.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Além disso, nosso primeiro beijo\N será uma memória preciosa.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:22.79,0:11:23.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Kana!
Dialogue: 20,0:11:23.94,0:11:25.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Me escuta!
Dialogue: 20,0:11:25.93,0:11:30.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Não quero beijar você, \Nquero beijar o Chiaki de verdade.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:30.39,0:11:32.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Não precisa de um clima especial, nem nada.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:32.94,0:11:34.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Só quero beijar você normalmente.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:34.68,0:11:37.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Não posso acreditar que tenha recorrido a isso.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:37.64,0:11:38.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Você está certa.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:38.88,0:11:40.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso foi errado.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:40.56,0:11:41.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiaki...
Dialogue: 20,0:11:41.41,0:11:43.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas, eu estava apenas fingindo!
Dialogue: 20,0:11:46.05,0:11:47.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso!
Dialogue: 20,0:11:47.12,0:11:49.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Finalmente te beijei!
Dialogue: 20,0:11:50.12,0:11:51.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Você é o pior.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:52.91,0:11:54.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Por que tão séria?
Dialogue: 20,0:11:54.64,0:11:56.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Era só uma brincadeira.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:56.47,0:12:00.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Da próxima vez, por que não começa o beijo\N fingindo que está sendo atacada por alienígenas?
Dialogue: 20,0:12:00.48,0:12:03.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Ou que tal um gol de futebol?
Dialogue: 20,0:12:08.59,0:12:09.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Vou embora.
Dialogue: 20,0:12:10.46,0:12:12.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Está fingindo estar brava?
Dialogue: 20,0:12:12.07,0:12:14.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso foi só mais uma atuação.
Dialogue: 20,0:12:14.15,0:12:16.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Já chega desses nossos duetos!
Dialogue: 20,0:12:18.48,0:12:19.93,Main,,0,0,0,,O que foi isso?
Dialogue: 20,0:12:19.93,0:12:21.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Como devo reagir a isso?
Dialogue: 20,0:12:23.16,0:12:24.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Kana-chan?
Dialogue: 20,0:12:27.93,0:12:29.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Próximo episódio: Afinação.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ShikawaSigns,,0,0,0,,
